diff --git a/etc/NEWS b/etc/NEWS
index 13810f81054..5d5c4e92d52 100644
--- a/etc/NEWS
+++ b/etc/NEWS
@@ -30,6 +30,25 @@ applies, and please also update docstrings as needed.
 
 * Changes in Emacs 32.1
 
++++
+** Cairo displays preserve native image transparency.
+The PNG, SVG, and WebP image loaders now retain their alpha channels
+when the ':background' image property is nil.  A non-nil background
+color continues to flatten transparent pixels against that color.
+Heuristic masks now preserve existing image alpha on Cairo displays.
+
++++
+** PGTK images can respect 'alpha-background'.
+A color-image descriptor that explicitly specifies ':background nil'
+is now composited without increasing the alpha of the background
+beneath it.  Omitting the property retains the usual image opacity.
+
+---
+** Image mode now prefers specialized image libraries.
+When a format can be loaded both by a specialized library and by
+ImageMagick, Image mode now follows the usual image loader precedence
+and selects the specialized library.
+
 ---
 ** Emacs no longer kills child processes after EPIPE.
 Previously, Emacs would immediately kill a child process and set its
